        "nobel_worthiness": "Detecting high-energy astrophysical neutrinos opened a new observational window on the universe and established neutrino astronomy as a field.",
        "attribution": "Halzen was a leading architect of the IceCube vision; Karle and Spiering made major contributions to the experiment and its scientific development.",
        "maturity": "The signal has been confirmed with growing event samples and complementary observations, supporting a durable discovery.",
        "uncertainties": [
