        "attribution": "Maldacena's original conjecture and Witten's influential development and clarification are central contributions; related ideas have a broader history.",
        "maturity": "The correspondence has undergone extensive mathematical and theoretical testing and has generated fruitful applications, but it lacks direct experimental confirmation as a description of our universe.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The scope of the claim is theoretical and its physical realization remains uncertain.",
